{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GHOST CAM is a haunting ghost photography VR and PC experience where you search for spirits to capture\u2014but what happens if a ghost captures you? \ud83d\udc40</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with a paranormal-detecting camera and a torch, you\u2019ll explore an abandoned bedroom that twists into a shifting labyrinth of secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for ghosts and capture them on film.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together a hidden story lurking beneath the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware\u2014some spirits don\u2019t like to be seen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the world warps around you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of ghost expert will you become\u2026 and what will you uncover along the way?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121930/extras/1b066fb5119993aed73623a8e6d70cf3.poster.avif?t=1769868404\" width=320 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121930/extras/1b066fb5119993aed73623a8e6d70cf3.webm?t=1769868404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121930/extras/1b066fb5119993aed73623a8e6d70cf3.mp4?t=1769868404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\ud83d\udc7b Test Your Ghost Photography Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your Polaroid-style camera to capture spirits and uncover ghostly traces, earning a Ghost Hunter ranking based on your actions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf19 \u201970s/\u201980s Haunted Horse Girl Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam through a surreal blend of childhood horse obsession, heartache, and vintage horror. Set in liminal spaces where faded ribbons, dusty stables, and ghostly hoofbeats, the past lingers like a restless spirit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f A Twisting, Haunted Dreamscape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore shifting liminal spaces, but beware\u2014 as the spirits can turn the dreamscapes into nightmares.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd0d Puzzle-Filled Ghost Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your camera to uncover hidden clues, piece together spectral remnants, and solve haunting escape-room-style puzzles to go deeper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc40 Encounters with Many Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all ghosts are hostile. Some watch, some guide, and some trap you in their world\u2014if the spirits let you, you\u2019ll unravel the truth beneath the surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcf8 Multiple Endings &amp; Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices matter\u2014different actions unlock new paths, ghost rankings, and hidden mysteries waiting to be discovered.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2121930?t=1769868404","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2121930?t=1769868404","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121930/443ab6bc0b4fe5d20e0e490e1a5baa21bec7efbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769868404","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121930/443ab6bc0b4fe5d20e0e490e1a5baa21bec7efbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769868404","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2628540,"descriptio